      "title_zh": "美联储理事会就《GENIUS法案》下监管支付稳定币发行方的两项提案公开征求公众意见",
      "title_orig": "Federal Reserve Board requests public comment on two proposals related to establishing a regulatory framework for Board-supervised payment stablecoin issuers under the GENIUS Act",
